## Summary

Danny has run a flower shop in Holon for 8 years and has no website. Everything currently goes through the phone. Yaniv proposed a site with online ordering and a WhatsApp integration for 6,500 ₪. Danny said that was a lot to pay at once and asked to split it. Yaniv agreed to three payments. The site will go live by the end of December.

## Key Points

- Danny's shop in Holon has been open for 8 years
- He wants customers to order a bouquet online, with each order sending him a WhatsApp message
- Price: 6,500 ₪, paid in three installments
- Deadline: end of December
- Danny will send photos of bouquets by Thursday

## Action Items

